OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy and dry this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight with the risk of patchy mist
OL,8,Fand fog. Generally less cold than
OL,9,FFriday night, but an inland frost
OL,10,Fstill likely in places by the morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FVariable cloud through the day
OL,13,Fwith isolated showers developing,
OL,14,Fthese mainly in the east. Remaining
OL,15,Frather cool with a reasonable breeze
OL,16,Fat times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
